* Minimoog board No. 4: circuit No. 7, the two voltage controlled amplifiers and the
* output stage.
*
* Source drawing: service manual Figure 9-11 (S-F911); reference designators are Figure
* 9-11's. The 1970 R. A. Moog drawing 1445 (S-RAM) has the same circuit. Three documented
* states of R2, R8/R28 (and the A-440's R40): 1970 (47K, 27 ohm, 1K), Folkman's July 1973
* kit (160K, 4.7 ohm, 10K; the owner's default, history.md), Figure 9-11 (82K, 8.2 ohm,
* 22K).
*
* Ports:
*   vin     the filter's output (into R2)
*   cont    pin 9, the loudness contour (into R59)
*   ext     pin 10, the EXT. LOUDNESS input; the rear jack J3 normally ties it to +10 V
*           through 33K (dwg 1445)
*   a440    the A-440 oscillator's output: through R40 and C8 onto Q14's collector, which is
*           the output stage's input (dwg 1445: "from A-440 circuit" to the output PNP's base)
*   main    pin 21, main output (through R77 1K)
*   phones  pin 22, to the headphone amplifier (through R75 1K)
*   vp vn   +10 V and -10 V
* Parameters: r2, r8 (R8 = R28), r40, r14 (1st VCA BAL wiper position, 0..1), r12 (2nd VCA
* BAL wiper position, 0..1).
.subckt mm_vca vin cont ext a440 main phones vp vn
+ params: r2=160k r8=4.7 r40=10k r14=0.5 r12=0.5

* --- the VCAs' decoupled supply chain -------------------------------------------------
r10   vp nl 120                     ; R10 120
c4    vp nl 220u                    ; C4 220 uF (across R10)
r11   nl nm 150                     ; R11 150
r13   nm nn 120                     ; R13 120
r22   nn bb 120                     ; R22 120
r36   bb 0 510                      ; R36 510: the first pair's bias node
c15   bb 0 220u                     ; C15 220 uF

* --- first VCA: Q16/Q15 (TIS97), tail from Q18 driven by the loudness contour ---------
rr2   vin n2 {r2}                   ; R2: input attenuator with R34
c6    n2 b16 0.33u                  ; C6 0.33 uF
r34   b16 bb 820                    ; R34 820
q16   c16 b16 e1 QTIS97             ; Q16
q15   c15 bb e1 QTIS97              ; Q15: base on the bias node
rr14a nn t14 {max(25*r14,1e-3)}     ; R14 25 ohm 1st VCA BAL: wiper at nn
rr14b nn u14 {max(25*(1-r14),1e-3)}
r19   t14 c16 100                   ; R19 100
r23   u14 c15 100                   ; R23 100
r35   e1 c18 1k                     ; R35 1K
q18   c18 b18 e18 QTIS97            ; Q18: the contour's current source
r59   cont b18 68k                  ; R59 68K
r37   e18 0 6.8k                    ; R37 6.8K
r43   e18 vn 270k                   ; R43 270K

* --- second VCA: Q14/Q13 (TIS97) on the first's collectors, tail from Q21 -------------
q14   c14 c16 e2 QTIS97             ; Q14: base on Q16's collector
q13   c13 c15 e2 QTIS97             ; Q13: base on Q15's collector
rr12a nm t12 {max(100*r12,1e-3)}    ; R12 100 ohm 2nd VCA BAL: wiper at nm
rr12b nm u12 {max(100*(1-r12),1e-3)}
r18   t12 c14 330                   ; R18 330
r21   u12 c13 330                   ; R21 330
r33   e2 c21 470                    ; R33 470
q21   c21 ext e21 QTIS97            ; Q21: base on the EXT. LOUDNESS input
r51   ext 0 33k                     ; R51 33K
r42   e21 0 3.3k                    ; R42 3.3K
r44   e21 vn 150k                   ; R44 150K

* --- the A-440 reference joins at the second VCA's collector -------------------------
rr40  a440 n40 {r40}                ; R40
c8    n40 c14 0.1u                  ; C8 0.1 uF

* --- output stage: Q12/Q17 (2N4058) with Q1 as their tail --------------------------------
q1    t1 nl e1b Q2N4058             ; Q1 2N4058: base on the chain's first node
r9    vp e1b 62                     ; R9 62
rr8   t1 e12 {r8}                   ; R8
rr28  t1 e17 {r8}                   ; R28
q12   c12 c14 e12 Q2N4058           ; Q12: base on Q14's collector
q17   o17 c13 e17 Q2N4058           ; Q17: base on Q13's collector
r30   c12 0 680                     ; R30 680
r29   o17 0 680                     ; R29 680
dcr2  0 o17 D1N458A                 ; CR2 1N458A: clamps the output above -0.6 V
dcr1  o17 vp D1N458A                ; CR1 1N458A: clamps it below +10.6 V
c2    o17 no 10u                    ; C2 10 uF
r75   no phones 1k                  ; R75 1K
r77   no main 1k                    ; R77 1K
.ends mm_vca
